import Dialogs from '../../components/Dialogs.astro';
import Seo from '../../components/Seo.astro';
import { css, js } from '../../lib/site';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff">
<title>Terms & Conditions — Favorite Hearts</title>
<meta name="description" content="Terms & Conditions for the Favorite Hearts information website. Read our website scope and contact us with questions.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("landing.css")}>
<script is:inline src={js("site-config.js")} defer>
</script>
<script is:inline src={js("site.js")} defer>
</script>
<script is:inline src={js("legal.js")} defer>
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("monochrome.css")}>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("legal.css")}>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("welcome.css")}>
<script is:inline src={js("welcome.js")} defer>
</script>
<script is:inline src={js("motion.js")} defer></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("design-system.css")}>
<link rel="stylesheet" href={css("tailwind.css")}>
<Seo route="/terms/" title={"Terms & Conditions — Favorite Hearts"} description={"Terms & Conditions for the Favorite Hearts information website. Read our website scope and contact us with questions."} headline={"Terms & Conditions"} />
</head>
<body class="tw-antialiased">
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<Header />
<Navigation />
<main id="main" class="legal-page" data-theme="light">
<section class="section legal-intro">
<p class="label">The details that matter</p>
<h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
<p class="legal-lead">A clear understanding, from the beginning.</p>
<p class="legal-date">Website edition · Updated 17 October 2026</p>
</section>
<div class="section legal-layout">
<aside class="legal-contents" aria-label="On this page">
<p>On this page</p>
<nav aria-label="Policy contents">
<a href="#scope">01 <span>Using this website</span>
</a>
<a href="#eligibility">02 <span>Who the website is for</span>
</a>
<a href="#availability">03 <span>Current and planned features</span>
</a>
<a href="#conduct">04 <span>Respectful and lawful use</span>
</a>
<a href="#content">05 <span>Articles and website content</span>
</a>
<a href="#payments">06 <span>Payments and subscriptions</span>
</a>
<a href="#ownership">07 <span>Content and intellectual property</span>
</a>
<a href="#external">08 <span>External services</span>
</a>
<a href="#privacy">09 <span>Privacy and communications</span>
</a>
<a href="#limits">10 <span>Availability and responsibility</span>
</a>
<a href="#changes">11 <span>Changes to these terms</span>
</a>
<a href="#contact">12 <span>Questions and concerns</span>
</a>
</nav>
</aside>
<article class="legal-body">
<section id="scope">
<p class="legal-number">01</p>
<h2>Using this website</h2>
<p>These terms cover the Favorite Hearts information website, including its articles, help pages, and contact links. By using the website, you agree to use it lawfully and in accordance with these terms. They do not create a paid subscription or a contract for a matching service. If you do not agree, please stop using the website.</p>
</section>
<section id="eligibility">
<p class="legal-number">02</p>
<h2>Who the website is for</h2>
<p>Favorite Hearts is intended for adults aged 18 and over who are interested in matrimony. If you enquire on behalf of another adult, be clear about your role and ensure you have appropriate authority to share their information. A family member’s involvement does not replace the candidate’s own choice.</p>
</section>
<section id="availability">
<p class="legal-number">03</p>
<h2>Current and planned features</h2>
<p>This website currently provides information and contact options. Registration, profile publishing, matching, payment processing, and verification are not available here. Descriptions of planned features explain our intended direction and may change. Specific service terms, pricing, and privacy information must be provided before those features are offered.</p>
</section>
<section id="conduct">
<p class="legal-number">04</p>
<h2>Respectful and lawful use</h2>
<p>Do not impersonate someone, submit misleading information, harass others, send unlawful content, misuse contact channels, or share information you are not authorised to share. Do not attempt to bypass access controls, disrupt the website, introduce malicious software, or extract personal information through unauthorised means.</p>
</section>
<section id="content">
<p class="legal-number">05</p>
<h2>Articles and website content</h2>
<p>Our relationship articles provide general ideas and information. They are not personalised legal, financial, medical, or psychological advice. An introduction, recommendation, or paid service cannot guarantee compatibility, a relationship, or marriage. Decisions about relationships remain with the people involved.</p>
</section>
<section id="payments">
<p class="legal-number">06</p>
<h2>Payments and subscriptions</h2>
<p>This website does not collect payments or activate subscriptions. Do not treat descriptions of future plans as an instruction to transfer money. Confirm any payment instructions directly with Favorite Hearts. Prices, subscription periods, cancellation terms, and any refund conditions will need to be provided before a paid service is offered. Nothing here removes rights that apply under consumer law.</p>
</section>
<section id="ownership">
<p class="legal-number">07</p>
<h2>Content and intellectual property</h2>
<p>The website’s text, design, branding, and other materials may be protected by intellectual property rights belonging to Favorite Hearts or their respective owners. You may browse and share links for personal use. Do not reproduce or commercially reuse protected material without permission unless the law allows it. Third-party photographs, logos, and platform names remain subject to their owners’ rights.</p>
</section>
<section id="external">
<p class="legal-number">08</p>
<h2>External services</h2>
<p>WhatsApp, social networks, email services, and other linked websites operate independently and have their own terms. A link does not guarantee their availability, content, or security. Check that a social profile belongs to the intended business before sharing information; some links currently lead to a search rather than a verified profile.</p>
</section>
<section id="privacy">
<p class="legal-number">09</p>
<h2>Privacy and communications</h2>
<p>Our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains this website’s privacy scope and contact options. Please keep sensitive information out of initial messages. Support hours are listed on our <a href="/contact/">Contact Us page</a>; a message sent outside those hours may be handled later. Favorite Hearts support is not an emergency service.</p>
</section>
<section id="limits">
<p class="legal-number">10</p>
<h2>Availability and responsibility</h2>
<p>We aim to keep the website useful and accurate, but content may contain errors and access may be interrupted or changed. Please contact us if something appears incorrect. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability or rights that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited. Any other limitation is subject to applicable law.</p>
</section>
<section id="changes">
<p class="legal-number">11</p>
<h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
<p>We may revise these website terms as the site develops and will update the date above. New product features may require additional terms and an appropriate acceptance process. A later update does not remove rights or obligations that already apply under law.</p>
</section>
<section id="contact">
<p class="legal-number">12</p>
<h2>Questions and concerns</h2>
<p>Contact Favorite Hearts at <a href="mailto:hello@favoritehearts.com">hello@favoritehearts.com</a> if you have a question or concern about these terms. Please describe the issue and give us an opportunity to respond. Nothing in these terms prevents you from seeking assistance or exercising rights through a competent regulator or court.</p>
</section>
<div class="legal-end">
<a class="pill" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>
<a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
</a>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</main><Footer />
<Dialogs />
</body>
</html>
